<title>AUSTRIA: Austria to tender 15 bln ATS 30-year bond.</title>
<headline>Austria to tender 15 bln ATS 30-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by Kontrollbank, the Austrian government's financing agent, on Monday.</p>
<p>ISSUER: Republic of Austria</p>
<p>AMOUNT: 15 billion ATS</p>
<p>MATURITY: July 15, 2027</p>
<p>AUCTION DATE: July 8, 1997</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12256</p>
</text>
